  @croissant-details: Details screen of a croissant item in a bakery website with price, ingredients and an add to cart button (not made yet)
  @cinnamon-roll-details: Details screen of a cinnamon roll item in a bakery website with price, ingredients and an add to cart button (not made yet)
  @baguette-details: Details screen of a baguette item in a bakery website with price, ingredients and an add to cart button (not made yet)
  @bakery-menu: Full menu of a small bakery website listing breads, pastries and cakes (not made yet)
  @bakery-account: Account screen of a small bakery website with profile and order history (this screen)

Design it for a phone screen, 390 px wide.

