  @baguette-details: Details screen of a baguette item in a bakery website with price, ingredients and an add to cart button (not made yet)
  @bakery-menu: Full menu of a small bakery website listing breads, pastries and cakes (this screen)

Design it for a phone screen, 390 px wide.

Design this as a clearly different alternative to the obvious layout: arrange this screen's content another way, not just the wording, and keep whatever the spec decides.

