messages.content:
A tiny bakery website

Screens of this mockup, as a tree:
@home: the first screen of A tiny bakery website (this screen)
  @bakery-cart: Shopping cart of a small bakery website with 1 sourdough loaf and 2 croissants
  @bakery-account: Account screen of a small bakery website with profile and order history
    @bakery-edit-profile: Edit profile form of a small bakery website with name, email and phone fields (not made yet)
  @bakery-menu: Full menu of a small bakery website listing breads, pastries and cakes
  @croissant-details: Details screen of a croissant item in a bakery website with price, ingredients and an add to cart button (not made yet)
  @cinnamon-roll-details: Details screen of a cinnamon roll item in a bakery website with price, ingredients and an add to cart button (not made yet)
  @baguette-details: Details screen of a baguette item in a bakery website with price, ingredients and an add to cart button (not made yet)

Design it for a phone screen, 390 px wide.

